6feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.redappleapp.app"]],["qgJIGkYIDhIbChkKE2NvbS5yZWRhcHBsZWFwcC5hcHAQARgDShMImozA7Z/plgMVqKWDAx1qqROt+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA"],null,[null,"Redapple is a groundbreaking tele-health platform that addresses critical socio-cultural problems, leverages epidemiological insights, and tackles health crises head-on. Redapple is specifically designed for Health Coaches and other holistic health providers, offering secure chat, video conferencing, scheduling, provider profiles, and more. With mobile native apps for iOS and Android, as well as web accessibility, Redapple is a global platform that transforms the way health coaching is delivered in the digital age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIn today\u0026#39;s fast-paced world, socio-cultural problems such as stress, sedentary lifestyles, poor nutrition, and mental health issues have become rampant. Epidemiological data reveals that chronic diseases, such as diabetes, heart disease, and obesity, are on the rise, posing a significant burden on individuals and healthcare systems globally. Health Coaches play a pivotal role in addressing these issues by promoting preventive healthcare, empowering individuals to make positive lifestyle changes, and providing personalized holistic health plans.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFurthermore, health crises, such as the recent COVID-19 pandemic, have highlighted the need for accessible and effective tele-health solutions. Redapple is uniquely positioned to meet this demand by offering a specialized platform for Health Coaches, who can play a critical role in promoting health and wellness remotely, even during times of crisis. Our platform ensures that Health Coaches can provide uninterrupted care to their clients through secure chat and video conferencing, scheduling, and other features, without any geographical barriers.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRedapple goes beyond traditional tele-health platforms by incorporating social media-like features, including connection requests and provider profile timelines with comments. This fosters a sense of community and engagement among Health Coaches and their clients, promoting a supportive and empowering environment for individuals to make positive changes to their health and well-being."],"Redapple Digital Health, Inc.","1,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/it9DR99CKDyOyF_is2Pf1SCQTPx7M_N0S7vwKPtl0pi1wqrUAyzDRwJhc5N6vdvpJWjkA7ZmD1g4oRTY9PcsDWM"],null,[252,252,252,255]],null,["Teen",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq"]],null,[null,"Users Interact"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.redappleapp.app\u0026rdid\u003dcom.redappleapp.app\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$99.99 per item",[0]]]],["Innovation Corner","Big ideas from up-and-coming companies",[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/collection/cluster?gsr\u003dSpoBCmcKHwobcHJvbW90aW9uX2luZGllX2FwcHNfY29ybmVyEAISPgo6bmV3X2hvbWVfZGV2aWNlX2ZlYXR1cmVkX3JlY3MyX3RvcGljX3YxX2xhdW5jaF9BUFBMSUNBVElPThACGgQKAggBaiwxNjhUTDBvUWpteFZlemhPYTRWeklwZlFHaEN0RlZ6QXhMaGkrdGlqZndvPfgBAA%3D%3D:S:ANO1ljIFX40"]]]]],[null,null,null,["qgJT