,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.mlink.ai.chat.assistant.robot"]],["qgKPARqMAQgAShMImozA7Z/plgMVqKWDAx1qqROt+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugRgCicKIWNvbS5tbGluay5haS5jaGF0LmFzc2lzdGFudC5yb2JvdBABGAMaKAohbWNfb3JwaGFuX2FpXzgwc19sb29rXzIwMjZfMDlfZmNjEJkBGAMiCwoAEgcxMjlhNzI4"],null,[null,"AI Chat app is built on the latest Top AI Models, including GPT-5, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Grok, Nano Banana and Claude technologies — we’re constantly updating to bring you the latest and smartest AI technologies.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur app offers a wide range of powerful AI features: AI Chat, AI Home Design, AI Art \u0026amp; Image ( built on Nano Banana ), AI Logo Generator \u0026amp; Tattoo Design, AI Photo Enhancer, Voice Chat, Real-Time AI Search, PDF/DOC/Webpage Summarizer, AI Photo Recognition, Plant Identifier, and Smart AI Assistants for any task.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re creating, learning, or just exploring — simply ask AI Chat anything and get fast, intelligent results.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Key Features】\u003cbr\u003e- AI Chat: Human-like Responses\u003cbr\u003eBuilt on GPT-5, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Grok, Nano Banana and Claude technologies, AI Chat brings you fantasy experience and Human-like responses!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-AI Home Design \u0026amp; Smart House Designer\u003cbr\u003eSimply upload a photo of your home, choose interior design style and color palette, and let AI Chat generate a stunning design for you in seconds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- AI Art \u0026amp; Logo Maker\u003cbr\u003eDesign professional art and logos effortlessly. Whether for your brand, project, or social media, our AI helps you create eye-catching visuals in seconds. Fast, easy, and 100% unique AI logo.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- AI Tattoo Generator \u0026amp; Design Ideas\u003cbr\u003eCreate custom tattoo designs with AI in seconds. Just describe your idea, and get unique, high-quality tattoo concepts instantly. Explore styles from minimal to detailed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- AI Photo / Image Generator\u003cbr\u003eWith AI Image Generator built on Nano Banana, you can bring your imagination to life easily. Just enter a prompt and instantly generate stunning AI images in any style — from realistic to fantasy. No design skills needed, just pure creativity.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-AI Voice Chat \u003cbr\u003eTalk Naturally, Listen Clearly!\u003cbr\u003eSay goodbye to typing fatigue! Now you can use voice chat with ai, enjoy smooth voice conversations with real-time speech interaction.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-AI Photo Enhancer\u003cbr\u003eBring Your Blur Photo Back to Life!\u003cbr\u003eUse AI enhance photo quality! Now you can upgrade your low-resolution photos with our blurry photo fixer.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Real-Time Web Search\u003cbr\u003eStay Current, Stay Informed!\u003cbr\u003eSay goodbye to data limitations! Now you can access to the real-time data by web search!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Smart AI Character \u0026amp; AI Assistant\u003cbr\u003eBuilt on GPT-5, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Grok, Nano Banana and Claude technologies, we have many customized AI Characters ready to help you with your daily tasks. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- AI Keyboard works in any app\u003cbr\u003e It features Grammar Check, Tone Changer, Ask AI, Paraphrase, Versify and many more.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- AI-Enhanced YouTube:\u003cbr\u003eHarness the power of AI Chat to get insightful summaries of your favorite YouTube videos.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- AI-Powered PDF Analysis:\u003cbr\u003eTransform lengthy PDFs into concise, actionable insights.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- AI Web Parsing\u003cbr\u003eAI Chat now intelligently distills web content, making complex information accessible at a glance.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Wide Range of Uses】\u003cbr\u003e- Essay Writer\u003cbr\u003eAI Chat uses natural language processing to help you write the perfect essay, so you can impress your professors and get better grades.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Language Learning\u003cbr\u003eBuilt on GPT-5, AI Chat can help you practice your grammar, vocabulary, and speaking skills.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Do Math, Photomath\u003cbr\u003eWith AI character built on GPT-5, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Grok, Nano Banana and Claude technologies, you can solve math problem and do photomath better, from basic arithmetic to advanced calculus.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith AI Chat, built on GPT-5, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Grok, Nano Banana and Claude technologies, you get a versatile personal assistant capable of answering any question, generating stunning AI art, and providing extensive support across various domains. Experience the future with AI Chat!"],"AI Chat Studio","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gSTbhKRPpJqx77G5FPSEh52CHbJFcqWLg63EK29ZJFBfnCfNnp_OD-W1eM-bkhZtHELskGCjNvjlRkzKyHlX"],null,[13,21,28,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,[null,"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language."],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.mlink.ai.chat.assistant.robot\u0026rdid\u003dcom.mlink.ai.chat.assistant.robot\u0026fea