u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.shakaguide.android"]],["qgKPARqMAQgDShMImozA7Z/plgMVqKWDAx1qqROt+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugRgChwKFmNvbS5zaGFrYWd1aWRlLmFuZHJvaWQQARgDGjMKLG1jX29ycGhhbl9uYXRpb25hbF9wYXJrc19oaXN0b3J5XzIwMjZfMDhfZmNjEJkBGAMiCwoAEgcxMjdjYjAz"],[[[null,null,"bGprKZ68Dik",[null,null,"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:bGprKZ68Dik?autoplay\u003d1\u0026embed\u003dplay"],"yt:movie:bGprKZ68Dik",null,null,null,null,"AXH1ezkSosE8BjA_t-y9pDLvRlHVCS0YXhrlV3ZAoQanbAcOS7KvgPDh8zswlSE_u8Q_wqXvDnTS7Xcb_iNyN0KrRrNZR4-I1wdLC7cKjc_uw3AhBm2aPQhCMmeS_o7EFE_hxOEAmtQ0K-7hK7SGOKuxePi9fsgG6OJPlbczZZ46oKFAf72Gxond0zZhI08lMSyS-oaaObU6xDhHpOcTh36LokZlCuqmC4brvpXU1dGEbKuThCrSBx9m73WTUinibVR-OwA-Cmon0mLvQk0xD1mDTe-cDMG3Thh6nYIjQy7hWw\u003d\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bGprKZ68Dik/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"\u003cb\u003eTurn Your Drive Into an Unforgettable Adventure\u003c/b\u003e 🚗 \u003cbr\u003eImagine this — you’re driving a winding coastal road. A waterfall appears around the bend. Right on cue, your phone starts telling you the story behind it. That’s how Shaka Guide works.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur GPS audio tours guide you as you drive, delivering a seamless driving tour experience with stories, music, and directions that play automatically — totally offline, no cell service or wifi needed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFrom the Road to Hana in Maui to Yellowstone National Park, explore 90+ self-guided audio tours designed to help you see more, stop at the right places, and never miss what matters.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith over 1 million downloads, a 4.7-star rating, and thousands of happy travelers, Shaka Guide helps you experience destinations in a whole new way.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eEXPLORE HAWAII, NATIONAL PARKS \u0026amp; MORE\u003c/h2\u003e🌎 \u003cbr\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re exploring Hawaii or visiting iconic destinations like Yellowstone and Yosemite, Shaka Guide helps you go beyond the usual stops and immerse yourself in the stories of these places.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🌺 \u003cb\u003eHawaii: Maui – including THREE Road to Hana Tours – Oahu, Kauai \u0026amp; Big Island \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🏞️ \u003cb\u003eNational Parks: Yellowstone, Grand Canyon, Yosemite, Acadia \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🏙️\u003cb\u003ePopular Towns \u0026amp; Cities: Sedona, Boston, Salem \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🚗 \u003cb\u003eScenic Drives: Blue Ridge Parkway, Overseas Highway \u0026amp; The Florida Keys \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🏛️\u003cb\u003eHistoric Sites: Gettysburg, Mount Rushmore, Monument Valley \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd so many more!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEach GPS audio tour is built around the route you’re driving — highlighting local gems, scenic viewpoints, and the stories that bring each place to life. Perfect for scenic drives and self-guided driving tours across Hawaii, national parks, and beyond.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHOW SHAKA GUIDE GPS AUDIO TOURS WORK\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003eJust download an audio tour, hit the road, and drive.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• Audio from your tour plays automatically based on your location\u003cbr\u003e• Works fully offline — no signal needed\u003cbr\u003e• Pre-planned routes with directions to must-see stops \u003cbr\u003e• Stories, tips, and local insights along the way\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNo schedules. No groups. No rushing. Just you, the road, and the experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWHY SHAKA GUIDE \u003c/h2\u003e 🤙\u003cbr\u003eThink of Shaka Guide as your personal tour guide, in the car with you. We’re your local friend that knows all the best stops, and the stories behind them.\u003cbr\u003eWith every audio tour, you’ll get:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✅ Storytelling and music that enhance your trip\u003cbr\u003e✅ Freedom to explore at your own pace – no time limits\u003cbr\u003e✅ Simple, hands-free design\u003cbr\u003e✅ A curated itinerary with top spots and local gems\u003cbr\u003e✅ Tours made by humans – real people research, edit and narrate our tours\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re driving the \u003cb\u003eRoad to Hana\u003c/b\u003e or exploring \u003cb\u003eYellowstone\u003c/b\u003e Shaka Guide\u0026#39;s audio tours help you experience more without the stress of planning.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePOPULAR AUDIO TOURS\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExplore some of our most popular self-guided audio tours:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🌴 Road to Hana, Maui\u003cbr\u003e🏞️ Yellowstone National Park audio tour\u003cbr\u003e🏜️ Grand Canyon audio tour\u003cbr\u003e🌲 Yosemite National Park audio tour\u003cbr\u003e🌄 Sedona, Arizona audio tour\u003cbr\u003e🍁 Acadia National Park audio tour\u003cbr\u003e🇺🇸 Gettysburg Battlefield audio tour\u003cbr\u003e🏝️ Oahu, Kauai \u0026amp; Big Island driving tours\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEach audio tour is designed to guide you stop-by-stop, with the right story at the right moment.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDRIVING \u0026amp; WALKING TOURS\u003c/h2\u003e🚶\u200d♂️ \u003cbr\u003eWhile Shaka Guide is best known for its GPS audio driving tours, we also offer walking tours in select destinations — perfect for exploring cities, historic sites, and landmarks on foot. Check out our walking tours in Boston, Salem, Honolulu, Waikiki and Gateway Arch National Park, just to name a few.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003e90+ SELF-GUIDED AUDIO TOURS\u003c/h2\u003e 🗺️ \u003cbr\u003eChoose from a growing library of GPS audio tours across Hawaii, national parks, and beyond — with new experiences added regularly.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSTART EXPLORING\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDownload Shaka Guide and turn your next trip into memories that will last a lifetime."],"Shaka Guide","100,000+",null,"",nul