,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/category/HEALTH_AND_FITNESS"]],"HEALTH_AND_FITNESS"]]]]],[null,[[["com.getmimo",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L6b68qSB3yeqDkTd9cmBvImYgPmn4bHujX75G-3mdXgeXi6ZAzaUPkKD-bvj3_HNOVpaRRymixZQ0-22xLra"],null,[206,167,243,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oK94A86SE3_vkv5NUb-hQ8FHOzpwypfTvDs6KcIqwf2for3l5Jvffh5oU0Hya4J_74_s6Q-8lQp_pfCLnv2i"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/43H4qEAwu0P8bIBbWEH_DkjvGXN42fap4qY1pdg4FFBj1HKk3knqe-pgybzww2QnAYIjANRUOf_S0E8cyHfhxg"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fbKpn3t8vcJdI2tPMwFPl0mwcSEh_yYucVdO6YmiWa_pNfA3otD7PTnlSDy838iEaAd7FxjJhBkMtGKr4KOAKw"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fz95axunlnqRuzufVlUsBeEofCdw3guMJXFWD9Ui4IDBcQf4w9HXoLD7yOsGPAjqxDPmJzSps0h5PO6MW_Ft"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L7--LqVPErf9p-m9ENmkKpUoWZl45-T1vennPDVIfuVmAZOkpGROC_RBepEIDsJVDb--94CtIKEIht94ZmqKhA"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EmikQx4RazP4aRPbGE9FMLGKXfXXoHG3pndLM3pwVk8mat_jCj82fuHIjLvnGSH8uK8svpq-xJ7HtOE2QcFJaA"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hrkukgWYS-tO1yjfG_vHWTv7CT-RfY5t2ardxbdb-SkV5A8oy17MwhVJzROfl-yuZZcujhyDP0u23g5dXsNycw"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/T7aR1KANSfWoOrMTRpfR2_oMKGpJSYo9LWqYra7pk1hR7jhqwSAvQwJj-946cyV7gI_AYBa9OFwzHTBCrc0ivQ"]]],"Learn Python Coding - Mimo",["4.7",4.668226],"Education",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.getmimo\u0026rdid\u003dcom.getmimo\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.getmimo"]],["qgJ5GncIBUoTCJqMwO2f6ZYDFailgwMdaqkTrfoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoESwoRCgtjb20uZ2V0bWltbxABGAMaKQoibWNfb3JwaGFuX2xlYXJuX3B5dGhvbl8yMDI2XzA4X2ZjYxCZARgDIgsKABIHMTI1N2E1Yg\u003d\u003d"],[[[null,null,"sA7liNyzhvQ",[null,null,"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:sA7liNyzhvQ?autoplay\u003d1\u0026embed\u003dplay"],"yt:movie:sA7liNyzhvQ",null,null,null,null,"AXH1ezmQ_KVohhAIrHhjMJejBz3snnnBVuyJCf--bgAuMMqncgMywwZn9Ae_88SLcYSEoEuL_43iEdWYaEGf7hcgcBv83h-jsuduBR0-q675Y0T-wUwqlpA3j_h2b8GDo6MwD80gGI-zhgDEw2_Fz3M2kndk4hbffzfaJRAAdAFLdM2K-hxEksaOkG8jm_Vs7Lr1NUORXQzOS9b729jzAmKxsoagWUDX7FZRqZy_CTIE039L9Ng1trBnqZAdZ6WdbasRuLY5xWwzyZ6cb8FrapsUBiNyswaP3eXr0myQvvtgXg\u003d\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sA7liNyzhvQ/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Learn to code in Python, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, or SQL, and master software development in the age of AI. Mimo: Learn Coding and programming is a coding app that takes you from zero programming skills to writing code and building AI-powered projects. Gain the knowledge to create production-ready software and pursue a job as a developer. Start building strong portfolio projects that help you stand out, future-proof your skills, and take the next step beyond just programming syntax. Get Mimo, master computer science, and launch your developer career now!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWho It\u0026#39;s For\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Mimo Learn to Code app stands out by guiding aspiring developers through a proven, structured learning process. Unlike other code learning apps that focus on passive tutorials, Mimo delivers hands-on, career-relevant coding skills and modern tools to learn programming. You progress from your first line of code where you learn SQL, HTML, JavaScript, learn Python or any other programming language, and master software development, building a portfolio of real-world apps that showcase your abilities.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat You Get With Mimo\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Mimo coding app is an all-in-one programming app that provides guided learning paths to help you learn computer science and build a portfolio.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Learn Python programming, learn JavaScript, HTML, CSS, SQL, Node.JS, React, TypeScript, Express.\u003cbr\u003e- Go from beginner to developer with structured paths in Front-End, Full-Stack, Python, and Backend development.\u003cbr\u003e- Build apps, websites, and tools for a professional portfolio that stands out.\u003cbr\u003e- Practice software development by building with AI to understand, edit, and improve your code—all reflecting how modern software is built.\u003cbr\u003e- Code anywhere with our mobile IDE. Write, run, and edit code (e.g. Python, JavaScriptm and HTML editor).\u003cbr\u003e- Master collaboration, tooling, and workflows used by modern developers.\u003cbr\u003e- Track progress, earn certificates, and stay motivated with streaks and leaderboards.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow It Works\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1. Learn to Code Step by Step\u003cbr\u003eStart with beginner-friendly interactive lessons in this Python coding app, further on with JavaScript, or HTML to learn programming and build a solid foundation.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e2. Build with AI Like Modern Developers\u003cbr\u003eUse AI to enhance your workflow, understand code, debug, and refine your work. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e3. Create Lasting Projects\u003cbr\u003eTurn your skills into apps, websites, automations, games, and other portfolio-worthy projects.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat Makes Mimo Different \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Mimo combines hands-on coding with AI-powered development tools.\u003cbr\u003eFrom your first project, you gain practical skills for today’s tech industry, supported by project experience and learning that sets you apart in the job market.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Learn coding by building software from the very beginning.\u003cbr\u003eYou’ll practice Python, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, SQL, TypeScript, and React. Build real software from day one.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Learn AI-driven software development.\u003cbr\u003eMimo helps you build coding skills faster by using AI to explore solutions, understand code, and move forward with confidence.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Gain lasting skills and build a portfolio that stays relevant as the industry evolves.\u003cbr\u003eMimo offers the tutorials ,such as the SQL, HTML, JavaScript or Python tutorial, skills, practice, and projects to get started.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReviews and Recognitions:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🏆 Google Play\u0026#39;s Editor\u0026#39;s Choice\u003cbr\u003e🏅Best Self-Improvement Apps\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- \u0026quot;This way, you can work learning to code into your daily routine whenever you have a few minutes.\u0026quot; – TechCrunch.\u003cbr\u003e- \u0026quot;The app\u0026#39;s lessons are bite-sized to make it easy to squeeze coding into your busy day.\u0026quot; – The New York Times.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLearn to code in popular programming languages like Python programming, HTML, JavaScript, CSS, SQL, and master modern software engineering. Build apps, understand code, gain confidence, and become a future-ready developer with Mimo.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDon’t just learn yesterday’s coding syntax or chase today’s vibe coding hype. Get the skills that make you a software developer of tomorrow. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eStart learning with Mimo now!"],"Mimo: Learn to Code","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ks_hezPfQarz37a0E2O28HPmTH0SFWrqwbtxTtZsxD434Sz-DSGtmZgGj-BANQrQjJi45NHu1BLkfW-S56AJ"],null,[23,25,49,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,[null,"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language."],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.getmimo\u0026rdid\u003dcom.getmimo\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$1.99 - $299.99 per item",[0]]],[[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.getmimo"]],["qgJ5GncIBUoTCJqMwO2f6ZYDFailgwMdaqkTrfoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoESwoRCgtjb20uZ2V0bWltbxABGAMaKQoibWNfb3JwaGFuX2xlYXJuX3B5dGhvbl8yMDI2XzA4X2ZjYxCZARgDIgsKABIHMTI1N2E1Yg\u003d\u003d"],[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.getmimo\u0026rdid\u003dcom.getmimo\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[null,"Learn to code Python on your phone"],[null,"Build skills for the tech future"],[null,2,[2160,3840],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PolMLT0ZjkoCEhwgjDWdNALJ70QPFfOubNFyK-WMladmqs5GMEctfG5okq8pOQ0F9MUbicFvWFI"],null,[205,248,255,255]],null,"Trending",[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/editorial?id\u003dmc_learn_python_2026_08_fcp"]],1,null,["Learn Python Coding - Mimo"],[[["Education",[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/category/EDUCATION"]],"EDUCATION"]]]]],[null,[[["net.tandem",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aMGqik1c1EhZkwyTjmfW9BJF1TQV4X5X23MfHbR-CxTHH7jkIgoYpLEiKAGVxr3jfI6zs0Db17xD4oIYcmGW"],null,[246,243,240,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RQgf2VyqCVc8pVcugIsRgOq79BopIvb1gFd4Zq5CvUI3eHIpP5FXcuBJWXMGxQjapcwgM2qvRxO4V9bJW0MZYg"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/v8zMfga9yl-ZORJDrklDmHfZ_ddWn9VDvyUNZtqNBIVBWcpvMJwnoQQ4lvkjj4yG-JWgZf2QLljxUGcEX2dqJg"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FL5tEVMmREj1MPrIgqXMhbXBJpnQa9sWTprM8pb3WGCd829TJPp21n_c7u6LvKgGE93CqFC5oSeztvyisac0"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0XDORWwDB2SdDcjaGXNVbqz4wr00PBw7X4iBh9PpadJlDIj-ISJRhK6dnc5E6GetzPKN6ClanSlNnMHOUOMYgg"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ha3OTbpzle_8Qh3U1ipnpkw-Wijrd4drJDEoi-FiattXRQ3PF8jPMJWatj1n34PDc3AF_BRFgRz8XfnyhIqF0w"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eEJ9WTVMceyY-cKedH1tCXQStTmexnSP9iB9nrbD5jVLnpIskie6JwHePbrzzgSbmkDie2z7MCNUKmhoT6nXOmQ"]],[null,2,[3840,2160],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mPf2Q8Nckj5GipVx1XmRspc7WRr7RqHGnf_0lK4YQf0DA6HRm6JQ7J1CsJvKwvso2y3NRBo_DMyqv1FNE0Jv"]]],"Tandem: Language exchange",["4.1",4.066539],"Education",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dnet.tandem\u0026rdid\u003dnet.tandem\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dnet.tandem"]],["qgKFARqCAQgGShMImozA7Z/plgMVqKWDAx1qqROt+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugRWChAKCm5ldC50YW5kZW0QARgDGjUKLm1jX29ycGhhbl9uYXRpdmVfbGFuZ3VhZ2VfcHJhY3RpY2VfMjAyNl8wOF9mY2MQmQEYAyILCgASBzExYWY5Y2Q\u003d"],null,[null,"Practice a language with native speakers and take it to the next level.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re aiming to learn a new language or improve fluency in one you already know, having engaging conversations with an exchange partner makes all the difference. You can even learn a language with international friends while expanding your skills and cultural understanding.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhatever your language goal is—language learning for travel, business, or personal growth—you can reach it while meeting new people and making friends around the globe. It’s easy: just choose a language you want to learn, find a Tandem member with similar interests, and you’re ready to go!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOnce you’re connected, the real fun begins! Learn from each other, practice speaking, and find fluency faster through conversation practice! Text, call, or even video chat—communication with your language exchange partner is as flexible as you need it to be. It’s the perfect way to meet people and improve your language skills at the same time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith Tandem, you can learn languages through 1-to-1 chats or with Parties, the ultimate group learning audio space. There are millions of Tandem members waiting for you, so find your people and start speaking their language today!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChoose from over 300 languages:\u003cbr\u003e- Spanish 🇪🇸🇲🇽\u003cbr\u003e- English 🇬🇧🇺🇸\u003cbr\u003e- Japanese 🇯🇵\u003cbr\u003e- Korean 🇰🇷\u003cbr\u003e- German 🇩🇪,\u003cbr\u003e- Italian 🇮🇹\u003cbr\u003e- Portuguese 🇵🇹🇧🇷\u003cbr\u003e- Simplified and Traditional Chinese 🇨🇳🇹🇼\u003cbr\u003e- 12 different sign languages, including American Sign Language.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDOWNLOAD TANDEM AND LEARN A LANGUAGE NOW!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTandem unites people across borders through language learning. Whether you’re looking to make international friends, talk to strangers, or connect with others who are passionate about languages, Tandem has it all.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eBETTER VOCAB\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSkip the tricky grammar tests and random phrases. Tandem allows you to focus on meaningful conversation practice, centered around topics you care about.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003ePERFECT PRONUNCIATION\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWant to sound like a native speaker? One way to help is to practice a language with your exchange partner until you’ve mastered every word and phrase.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSOUND LIKE A LOCAL\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePractice a language with voice notes, audio, and video chats until you sound like a native speaker. No matter If you’re looking for tips on pronunciation or want to speak more casually in your fluency.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eMAKE INTERNATIONAL FRIENDS\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTandem connects you with international friends who share your passion for language learning. You’ll not only practice speaking, but also gain insights into various cultures. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eIMMERSIVE GROUP LEARNING\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExperience group learning like never before with Tandem’s interactive Parties! Use them to practice a language by listening in on group conversations or take the lead and start your own language Party.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eGRAMMAR TIPS \u0026amp; TRICKS\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUse translation features and text corrections to master grammar from the first try, whether you are perfecting everyday speech or understanding formal speech.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApp Access Permissions:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOptional permissions:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Location information: Required to use the Nearby feature to see members near you, the Travel feature to show members around the world and to add an approximate location to your profile.\u003cbr\u003e- Microphone: Required for sending audio messages, making audio and video calls, and joining Language Parties.\u003cbr\u003e- Camera: Required for taking photos to upload to your profile or post in a Language Club, take and send a photo in a chat, video calling, and scanning QR codes.\u003cbr\u003e- Notifications: Used to send you notifications about acceptance into the community, new messages, new followers and their posts, new references and marketing communication.\u003cbr\u003e- Nearby devices: Bluetooth access is required to connect audio devices during a call or Language Party.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou can still use Tandem without granting optional permissions, except features where their nature requires the respective permission, like a video call requiring camera permission.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGot a question? Contact us on support@tandem.net"],"Tripod Technology GmbH","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yETW9Gvqw4sUkQFEcgydWyvvjzRXnM9fTWdgagDU_qo33E1pZjul0o23_sco4dzji1_nQtir_5jX-vMy7D83cA"],null,[43,54,208,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dnet.tandem\u0026rdid\u003dnet.tandem\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$1.49 - $180.00 per item",[0]]],[[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dnet.tandem"]],["qgKFARqCAQgGShMImozA7Z/plgMVqKWDAx1qqROt+gEPCg0