52vd5DHpbUoLNWEwcht665qe75sR7pV7zj6uixA7lq2sFhUS9ooD13G6z9rA0m9Vsd8XA"]]],"AI Chatbot - Nova",["3.8",3.7998676],"Productivity",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.scaleup.chatai\u0026rdid\u003dcom.scaleup.chatai\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.scaleup.chatai"]],["qgJdGlsICBIaChgKEmNvbS5zY2FsZXVwLmNoYXRhaRABGANKEwiajMDtn+mWAxWopYMDHWqpE62aARMImK/JvPnolgMVhqKDAx01jiI2+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA"],null,[null,"Trusted by millions of users worldwide, Nova is an all-in-one AI chatbot and assistant that helps you write, learn, and get instant answers securely and effortlessly.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBuilt on the latest OpenAI GPT-5.6, Google Gemini 3.6 Flash, Anthropic Claude Opus 5, Kimi K3, xAI Grok 4.5, and DeepSeek V4 Pro, Nova delivers fast and reliable AI assistance, helping you stay productive, creative, and informed in one seamless experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to write better, learn faster, or get instant answers, Nova brings the power of advanced chatbot AI into one simple experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWHAT IT DOES\u003cbr\u003eNova helps you handle everyday tasks with ease using a powerful AI chatbot assistant:\u003cbr\u003e • Get instant answers with an advanced AI chatbot built on OpenAI GPT-5.6\u003cbr\u003e • Generate images with AI\u003cbr\u003e • Search the web for real-time information\u003cbr\u003e • Write, rewrite, and improve content with an AI writer built on OpenAI GPT-5.6.\u003cbr\u003e • Generate ideas for social media, business, and creativity\u003cbr\u003e • Translate and communicate in 140+ languages\u003cbr\u003e • Discover personalized recommendations (books, movies, more)\u003cbr\u003e • Use voice mode for hands-free interaction\u003cbr\u003e • Work on files like Word, Excel, and more\u003cbr\u003e • Scan and solve problems instantly (documents, questions, homework)\u003cbr\u003e• Generate, explain, and debug code with AI-powered coding assistance\u003cbr\u003e• Research topics in depth and explore complex ideas\u003cbr\u003e• Compare information, analyze sources, and uncover key insights\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKey capabilities:\u003cbr\u003e• Image generation\u003cbr\u003e• Voice mode\u003cbr\u003e• Web search\u003cbr\u003e• AI chatbot for real-time conversations\u003cbr\u003e• AI proofreader for grammar, clarity, tone, and rewriting\u003cbr\u003e• AI coding assistant\u003cbr\u003e• Deep research and analysis\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFrom quick questions to complex workflows, Nova delivers fast, natural responses built on OpenAI GPT-5.6 and advanced AI models, with real-time insights and context-aware intelligence built on DeepSeek V4 Pro.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTrusted by millions of users worldwide, Nova is a leading AI chatbot for writing, productivity, and everyday AI assistance.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWHY IT’S EASY\u003cbr\u003eNova is built to be intuitive, fast, and effortless.\u003cbr\u003e• One-tap AI chat, start using the AI chatbot instantly\u003cbr\u003e • Clean, intuitive interface\u003cbr\u003e • Cross-device sync, continue your chatbot AI experience anywhere\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow it works:\u003cbr\u003eAsk your question\u003cbr\u003eChoose your goal (write, learn, create)\u003cbr\u003eGet instant AI-powered results\u003cbr\u003eNo setup. No complexity. Just results with your personal AI chatbot assistant.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTRUST \u0026amp; SECURITY\u003cbr\u003eYour data and privacy are a priority.\u003cbr\u003eNova follows modern security principles:\u003cbr\u003e• Data minimization\u003cbr\u003e• No unnecessary tracking\u003cbr\u003e• Secure processing infrastructure\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYour AI chatbot conversations stay private and under your control.\u003cbr\u003eNova is built with a privacy-first mindset, ensuring your interaction with the AI chatbot remains secure, reliable, and protected.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://novaapp.ai/privacy\u003cbr\u003eTerms of Service: https://novaapp.ai/terms\u003cbr\u003eSupport: support@novaapp.ai\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWORKS EVERYWHERE\u003cbr\u003eNova works seamlessly across all phones and tablets.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMulti-language AI support (140+ languages)\u003cbr\u003eBuilt on leading AI systems:\u003cbr\u003eOpenAI GPT-5.6 • Google Gemini 3.6 Flash • Anthropic Claude Opus 5 • Kimi K3 • xAI Grok 4.5 • DeepSeek V4 Pro\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWHY NOVA\u003cbr\u003e• All-in-one AI chatbot \u0026amp; assistant  Built on OpenAI’s GPT-5.6 model\u003cbr\u003e • Fast and creative chatbot AI responses\u003cbr\u003e • Designed for everyday productivity and creativity\u003cbr\u003e • Continuous improvements with evolving AI technologies\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTrusted by millions of users worldwide, Nova is your all-in-one AI chatbot and assistant for work, learning, and creativity, built on OpenAI GPT-5.6, Google Gemini 3.6 Flash and Anthropic Claude Opus 5.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDESIGNED FOR EVERYDAY AI USE\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• AI chat, writing, and productivity assistant with image generation, web search, and voice mode\u003cbr\u003e• For students, professionals, creators, and teams, supports Word, Excel, and more\u003cbr\u003e• Fast, simple, and powerful, with scan and solve capabilities\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFrom simple questions to advanced tasks, Nova makes AI accessible, useful, and powerful for everyone."],"ScaleUp","100,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PDDyQDQaddQ1_3PorAT0wpZE3n7cqUMPpW74RvOximyVHyfdj2Gt6qhIVrCZJ6SPIHYMC2IxdG217boNYGW4DQ"],null,[10,25,29,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q