ic for YouTube, Instagram and TikTok. Want to get more likes on your social media? Download this video editor \u0026amp; video maker now!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eBasic Video Editing\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Multi-layer timeline] An intuitive and sleek editing interface with zoom for frame-by-frame precision with overlay video editor app.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Text] Edit, duplicate, and modify styles (variety of fonts \u0026amp; emoji, color, opacity, shadow, stroke).\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Trim videos] Professional tools developed for precise Video Editing App.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Split videos] Split videos and optimize them for sharing.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Combine video clips] Merge clips into a stunning video with transitions effects; combine video clips into one video. \u003cbr\u003e[Speed Control] Fast \u0026amp; slow motion video like a pro, only with VivaCut Video - Pro Video Editing App!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eAdvanced Video Editing\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Green Screen/Chroma key] Combine/mix videos like a Hollywood-level movie. Best chroma key video editor app \u0026amp; video background changer editor.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Keyframe Animation] Apply to Mask, Video Collage, Text, Stickers, Emoji, etc. Pro aesthetic video editor app.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Mask] Linear, mirror, radial, rectangle, and oval, all for the scene. Full-screen video editor for YouTube.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Picture in Picture] Combine clips together to create double exposures and eye-catching YouTube videos with transitions for free.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Collage] Add pictures to your clips and edit videos, then go viral with VivaCut!\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Overlay options] Customize layers with tools such as opacity and blending.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Blend videos] Mix videos using powerful blending modes such as Color Burn, Multiply, Screen, Soft Light, Hard Light, etc. VivaCut - best video background changer editor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eEffect \u0026amp; Filter \u0026amp; Transition\u003c/b\u003e\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Video Transition] Create amazing effects with cinematic overlay video editor with transition effects in VivaCut, a movie-level video background changer editor.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Filters] Edit videos/combine video clips with adjustable filters and effects.\u003cbr\u003e[Glitch Effects] Coolest video editing app with glitch effects and transitions!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eTrendy Music\u003c/b\u003e\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Music Marker] Mark the track and add effects according to the music rhythm. Pro video editor app with music and effects.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Audio Extraction] Aesthetic video editor with transition effects: extract music/audio from any video. Pro video editing app with sound effects.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Templates] Create your own music videos by automatically adding unique filters and cool effects to video templates.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSave \u0026amp; Share\u003c/b\u003e\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Custom video resolution] Export videos in 720p, 1080p, and 4k.\u2028\u003cbr\u003e[Rename] Rename video and mark memory with PRO aesthetic video editor.\u2028Save videos directly with transition effects to your device\u0026#39;s gallery, non-destructive video maker. One-click sharing to YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Snapchat, etc.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVivaCut is a pro video editor and video editing app with all features you need! It\u0026#39;s a video maker with music for cutting and splitting videos. Take a leap for your video and experience the next PRO video editor generation\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSubscription\u003cbr\u003e- Your subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period\u003cbr\u003e- Your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAcknowledgements:\u003cbr\u003eMusic by audionautix.com and https://icons8.com/music/"],"Ai Propulse2026","100,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ckzoTfqYzl7jkmtmtAKG9YeSMTNtUkHdYVfSxpFx0gkqHsMk-B-pzrlyJ4fNxbNKySMF0yL79dweJZEPxWuDig"],null,[22,23,23,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.videoeditorpro.android\u0026rdid\u003dcom.videoeditorpro.android\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.99 - $79.99 per item",[0]]],[["com.nexstreaming.app.kinemasterfree",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Jc_gKnGxM5p4_FuWQ_v2k6HlMaCcExeIDt--PkcWrLj_VQ2OyMPhDaycC1s9wG3yOwjviVA4M1go0O-foAx0"],null,[255,255,255,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1024,500],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UDZX1O5H4iJ6wSsU81kiA-66nXsxg8i6eGwRxr0YOeCajcrX8pNfONUCH5wUblgvpZszh_3GuRZY9ElzuXvqWA"]],[null,2,[1280,720],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wihEVSc9J2AN7ia9ROBUJvOsiHgPTI5s9JTh9lxwsLlGnmihPKUo3Dq12ro-pzNxGAVMooDaWAghQ6HcG6Ciuw"]],[null,2,[1280,720],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KVOnr2EANnIOiPWdolM12JzUEFTURtodelGUnGLvkBPHpyNEoGynWwW_rRESJqILlzZrYZX7o26Qm5L0i-uk"]],[null,2,[1280,720],[null,null,"ht