t1HJXOJnEAQGFbJMjSssaCTXwW2iPODy-jlRrg1PwZU8_hj0lkzS83WvNJC3kfk2ym07VMz9YTolS05YLtVukatxpOKH4euFuFKhhIKMJBNoUbEacLrfTZu0Y91HTEx9bUXdMiKKatqvhrffOXV1P8g4qwjDuieY79agbnKU2VDwZwPansM-0VNPmg9SlhUVEAqaFDHVulVrg3dw\u003d\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D4B7l3_s87Q/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Ignite your creative potential with Picsart — the all-in-one AI photo editor, AI video editor, and design studio that’s free and easy to use. From business designs to AI art, go from inspiration to creation fast. Create with an AI photo generator and AI video generator, edit with an AI image editor, remove backgrounds with Background Remover (BG remover), erase objects with Object Remover (Object Eraser), apply AI effects, filters, and retouch tools, and turn ideas into designs with templates, collages, story maker, and more. Create with new image-to-video tools, AI video avatars, AI try-on, AI avatars, Gen AI Studio, AI Playground, and Picsart Persona.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMEET PICSART AURA\u003cbr\u003eChat your vision into visuals. Built on Picsart’s platform and trusted by 150M+ creators, Aura is your creative partner. From prompt to design in seconds, Aura creates, edits, and refines in one conversation. It suggests prompts, generates AI photos and AI videos, remembers chats, and lets you share sessions.\u003cbr\u003eAura combines AI models to create and edit AI images and videos. Use Nano Banana™ for image generation and video models like Veo™ (Veo 3), Kling, Runway, and Luma. Availability may vary. Trademarks belong to their owners.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKICK-START PROJECTS WITH TEMPLATES\u003cbr\u003e• Use customizable templates made by professional editors.\u003cbr\u003e• Create logos with AI logo maker, social posts, stories, business cards, posters, and more.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTRANSFORM DESIGNS WITH BACKGROUND REMOVER\u003cbr\u003e• Remove background for clean cutouts and product shots.\u003cbr\u003e• Smart Background blends seamless backdrops — a fast background changer for ads and promos.\u003cbr\u003e• Remove background, refine edges, and create aesthetic styles for photo editor projects.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eREMOVE OBJECTS WITH EASE\u003cbr\u003e• Object Remover / Object Eraser deletes unwanted objects. \u003cbr\u003e• Remove clutter and imperfections for a clean photo.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGET CREATIVE WITH AI\u003cbr\u003e• AI Image Generator / AI photo generator: turn text into AI art, images, and GIFs.\u003cbr\u003e• AI video generator: create videos from text, images, or ideas in seconds.\u003cbr\u003e• AI Enhance instantly boosts image quality for better photo retouch. \u003cbr\u003e• Apply stylized AI filters and AI effects to create stunning photo effects in your photo editor workflow.\u003cbr\u003e• AI Replace transforms images with face swaps, hair color changes, and selfie edits.\u003cbr\u003e• AI Retouch perfects portraits with advanced skin, face, and detail enhancements for flawless retouch results.\u003cbr\u003e• AI Expand extends images beyond the frame.\u003cbr\u003e• AI Try-On lets you experiment with outfits and styles instantly.\u003cbr\u003e• AI Writer creates captions, text, and marketing copy for your content needs.\u003cbr\u003e• Upload selfies to generate customized AI avatar in different styles.\u003cbr\u003e• Explore new ideas in AI Playground and create faster with Gen AI Studio.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT VIDEOS LIKE A PRO\u003cbr\u003e• Use the easy video editor to create and edit clips with music.\u003cbr\u003e• Generate and edit videos with AI video tools, effects, text, and trendy filters.\u003cbr\u003e• Turn images into motion with image-to-video tools.\u003cbr\u003e• Create short-form edits that shine on any platform.\u003cbr\u003e• Add your best moments to a video collage.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eADD YOUR FLAVOR WITH THE STICKER MAKER\u003cbr\u003e• Discover 60M+ stickers.\u003cbr\u003e• Add stickers to pictures or business promos.\u003cbr\u003e• Create custom stickers.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTELL YOUR STORY IN TEXT\u003cbr\u003e• Add text with the Picsart Text Editor.\u003cbr\u003e• Discover hundreds of classic \u0026amp; trendy fonts.\u003cbr\u003e• Customize text styles. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCREATE COLLAGE MAGIC (COLLAGE MAKER)\u003cbr\u003e• Create fun photo collages with your favorite photos.\u003cbr\u003e• Try photo grid collage or freestyle collage for mood boards and frames.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDISCOVER ENDLESS INSPIRATION\u003cbr\u003eFrom solopreneurs to graphic design enthusiasts, AI art pioneers, and photo editors — share your ideas and get inspiration for your next project with Picsart Spaces.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUPGRADE YOUR DESIGN EXPERIENCE\u003cbr\u003ePicsart Plus: premium content, templates, and extra retouch features.\u003cbr\u003ePicsart Pro: more AI tools, extra team seats for small businesses, and more storage space.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTerms and conditions: https://picsart.com/terms-and-conditions\u003cbr\u003eAbout Ads: https://picsart.com/privacy-policy#interest-base"],"PicsArt, Inc.","1,000,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nY4APZoMuq7w6mrp93LkqIP0dDeiriBUfzqWb2buRGJnM7PDEXbSYP2_sFmeW6iMVr9EehI6nJnTIp9AYWiTmg"],null,[0,0,0,255]],null,["Teen",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.picsart.studio\u0026rdid\u003dcom.picsart.studio\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.99 - $219.99 per item",[0]]],[["com.intsig.camscanner",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XSoqEDquJuenUosbMN_EA2n2U5lsomPEUdCKj4j9bUdPfdWMCtRqXlyPgQ6zxQxWaDFIXrqbqyFjwXQ5FMYubw"],null,[3,24,46,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Iyd412QBd0ItoqS7jgzT6m5eHDGtx3dS9eKEEfw-m65P6DrxwQ8tCQNJ-MiNzpVWPFq4r2MJUBRvgvsmqJ8R-Q"]],[null,2,[2208,1243],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PSknNb2sV8T-OAaD-GG7JllK7bJunbNls4NlCCailourKYiItFt8e-MhEK8W7MqEwQJHp8pK4vnzhhMoysxI5g"]],[null,2,[2208,1243],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Pyv7rAHk6zaNCpKPgkculVrTDEHHh5T-YsUMf-oZJRnMGA4E4UUHyG2dF6j07fi2OqYNKi-UrtH8se-jIpuf"]],[null,2,[2208,1243],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8mLtTnKNSrJfuDCIpR524z5Wzx2ZqNOS53bFSgFMQS9BT4Tdy7TnhpH7ki7EDsvLCKmf0jcSriDQcRvAtibP"]],[null,2,[2208,1243],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c7-qhz551LiINA568DhKl46bVhiLUwOIgCaaSvlSZ9j3BCo2Kws7-IPJYnGwGdY997r9fhucscRvl6ic3EclrQ"]],[null,2,[2208,1243],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QTuR-tf6PAjxu-ZHzBSwwJmV62GVj_Q40gwp5z-h3YqOrzdic9hBFlnErckzArbsarWuFGc7_fxhmXFcfdtltDc"]],[null,2,[2208,1243],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/U-nfECbrpMECaz_TFHGd2_RHMzYYcBp9Lg4-wo-nF6p7udBAS4bb3D6PWT9BPcIRlbtch4ZmbEkVWNPIlUJLuv4"]],[null,2,[2208,1243],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5pWVT1S7sh3xWWOFp5FxUOwxnrsW-VA9vXYAIdMiggHkRViQaaEoSj5_3hEfT-ije3U7ox2eq_DxgDajJta-"]]],"CamScanner- scanner, PDF maker",["4.6",4.6215115],"Productivity",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.intsig.camscanner\u0026rdid\u003dcom.intsig.camscanner\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.intsig.camscanner"]],["qgJgGl4IEhIdChsKFWNvbS5pbnRzaWcuY2Ftc2Nhbm5lchABGANKEwiajMDtn+mWAxWopYMDHWqpE62aARMImK/JvPnolgMVhqKDAx01jiI2+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA"],null,[null,"Looking for an efficient scanner app?\u003cbr\u003eTry CamScanner! CamScanner is an all-in-one scanner app. It turns your mobile device into a powerful portable scanner that recognizes text automatically (OCR) and improves your productivity to save your time. Download this scanner app to instantly scan, save, and share any documents in PDF, JPG, Word, or TXT formats.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWould you like to keep your entire office in your pocket and increase your productivity at work? \u003cbr\u003eUse the CamScanner scanner app to handle your paperwork with ease. Say goodbye to huge and heavy copy machines and get this ultra-fast scanner app now.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* CamScanner has over 300 million users across over 200 countries and regions worldwide.\u003cbr\u003e* Over 500,000 new registrations per day\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFEATURES\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Quickly Digitize Documents\u003cbr\u003eThe CamScanner scanner app uses the camera on your mobile device to scan and digitize all kinds of paper documents: receipts, notes, invoices, whiteboard discussions, business cards, certificates, etc.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Optimize Scan Quality\u003cbr\u003eSmart cropping and auto enhancing ensure the text and graphics in your scans are clear and sharp with premium colors and resolutions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Extract Text\u003cbr\u003eThe optical character recognition (OCR) feature of this scanner app enables you to recognize text in images or PDFs. You can extract the text for later searching, editing, or sharing.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Share PDF/JPEG Files\u003cbr\u003eWith this PDF scanner, you can easily share documents in PDF or JPEG format with friends in multiple ways: share with social media, send attachments or download links through email, etc.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Wireless Printing \u0026amp; Remote Fax\u003cbr\u003eInstantly and wirelessly print out any documents in the CamScanner scanner app with a nearby printer without installing any applications or drivers. You can also select documents from the app and remotely fax them to over 30 countries and regions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Advanced Document Editing\u003cbr\u003eMake annotations on documents using a full set of editing tools in this PDF scanner. You can also add a customized watermark to mark your own documents.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Quick Search\u003cbr\u003eHave trouble finding the documents you want? With the CamScanner scanner app, you can tag your documents and find them with ease. Besides, the OCR feature enables you to search for images based on their content. With this PDF scanner, you can quickly find the document you want.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Secure Important Documents\u003cbr\u003eIf you want to protect confidential content, you can set a password for viewing. You can also set a password to the document download link to ensure better security.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Sync Across Platforms\u003cbr\u003eSign up to access documents on all your devices. You can sign in on your smartphone, tablet, or computer (visit www.camscanner.com) to sync your documents. In this way, you can view, edit and share any document with the CamScanner scanner app on the go.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUNLIMITED ACCESS MEMBERSHIP SUBSCRIPTION\u003cbr\u003e* You can subscribe to get unlimited access to all features of the scanner app.\u003cbr\u003e* Subscriptions are billed weekly, monthly, quarterly, or annually at the rate based on the subscription plan.\u003cbr\u003e* Payment will be charged to Google Play Store at confirmation of purchase.\u003cbr\u003e* Subscription renews automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\u003cbr\u003e* Account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. The cost depends on the selected plan.\u003cbr\u003e* Subscriptions may be managed by the user, and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user\u0026#39;s Account Settings after purchase.\u003cbr\u003e* Any unused portion of the free trial will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe\u0026#39;d love to hear your feedback: support@camscanner.com\u003cbr\u003eFollow us on X: @CamScanner\u003cbr\u003eLike us on Facebook: CamScanner\u003cbr\u003eFollow us on Instagram: @CamScanner_Official\u003cbr\u003eFollow us on YouTube: @CamScanner_Official\u003cbr\u003eFollow us on TikTok: @CamScanner_official"],"INTSIG PTE","500,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rcdZup0-gEr5Uq_-yTl2SM_Q72FbOU4_WiKhnGoswQrPZria3tj6K78h8XwI6_J0KCkB5zbxxFu93WNtn4tlras"],null,[7,72,78,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.intsig.camscanner\u0026rdid\u003dcom.intsig.camscanner\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.49 - $399.99 per item",[0]]],[["com.quvideo.xiaoying",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rjnN3LbXAOZGUKPP__3NSIoj6ncjC4ANFqS5cngwJ96bqsYYaV4PsNJSkAQAl9hEeEbNlraxuhA9m6vMpbiu7z0"],null,[255,74,1,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EEToGlQ11SLDRYWapPD13ux2rW_Db3VjFEARX3opv6tYUb48juRvcANJ1NOs_syJ0YduPPJP7IG4xHVKGgrPBQ"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c36p0w0-Kt01EpmpG-Pu1Ye8j1Fps7-5YOjyEaOd6tGj1SDmjdsALP-hSg0fsEX94H30E-ogxS_rnUL_a1Gu"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RXohcs6JFjdPiP9v0jILAvumal6RUqeLj57J8YfTSM0gnvRSLa0Cqm27NYe1M6TrhVG7VBvUy-MU8nJ-XzON_q4"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-WFqUeEWIZtXpf0Q20YUm7MkXDmBGkvrAIBLF6fFBRdKkvbQKFB5MXbJHDgTrn_dGOD_VOcLqAA0n7EVg2qOhA"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fZ_XPEgiWmISlXKSl-U0J7O8mZ4KavNwCKFCLpNVT4vID1a423CZV9xoa41-KNzAWK3KYyOo36GpqmYTb3-95xs"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mBpKld3PHyrsmkeZ6SgerkVmpwYSHGhwHYavZFZMy1N014s_b9N5OYjjKG-s-hcHrX40NPiAfUMx9K_1NIfW"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h_JSJVttVNMOY7zkLy9xLQ1R4cI3ydQDdP-6c7u1Je3EUl_9--CIbaClH5yUUEhnSq2JRc39O47eUN9C3JXApA"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YbUhFzYTkHFniu_bNsfi4l4Iyef1sghCRgool95lmQUuww1QX-ejKm15-UPr6nsv7QnBfKH29uMaojnNg8NO"]]],"VivaVideo - Video Cut \u0026 Editor",["4.3",4.286821],"Video Players \u0026 Editors",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.quvideo.xiaoying\u0026rdid\u003dcom.quvideo.xiaoying\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.quvideo.xiaoying"]],["qgJnGmUIExIcChoKFGNvbS5xdXZpZGVvLnhpYW95aW5nEAEYA0oTCJqMwO2f6ZYDFailgwMdaqkTrZoBEwiYr8m8+eiWAxWGooMDHTWOIjb6ARcKFQiOx7uZjpHSikMSCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\u003d\u003d"],null,[null,"\u003cb\u003eVivaVideo: Your free AI creative partner to turn imagination into influence. More intuitive for beginners, more powerful for pros.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGenerate AI videos, create one-tap Reels, and edit like a pro — all in one app. Share stories that grow your audience across TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, and beyond.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFREE \u0026amp; No Ads!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003ePowerful AI Video Tools\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Track moving objects with Smart Tracking to create dynamic, professional shots.\u003cbr\u003e- Sync video highlights with AI Beat for perfectly timed edits.\u003cbr\u003e- Generate AI Auto Captions — speech-to-text \u0026amp; translation in one tap.\u003cbr\u003e- Create AI Avatars: turn text into talking clips with voice customization. Powered by Veo 3 AI.\u003cbr\u003e- Generate custom AI Music based on your ideas or lyrics.\u003cbr\u003e- Clone your voice with AI Voice Clone — add customized emotions in any language.\u003cbr\u003e- Animate your photos with AI hug, AI kiss, and AI muscle effects (Image to Video).\u003cbr\u003e- Remove backgrounds or isolate objects with AI Cutout — smart strokes, instant results.\u003cbr\u003e- Enhance videos with advanced Slow-Motion for cinematic smoothness.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eUser-friendly Video Editing for Beginners\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Trim, cut, split, or merge video clips without losing quality.\u003cbr\u003e- Control speed with customizable \u0026amp; pre-set speed curves.\u003cbr\u003e- Add smooth transitions and visual effects.\u003cbr\u003e- Customize text styles \u0026amp; fonts for titles and captions.\u003cbr\u003e- Add fun stickers \u0026amp; emojis to bring personality.\u003cbr\u003e- Adjust brightness, contrast \u0026amp; saturation for better visuals.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFull-featured Video Editing for Professionals\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Create smooth animations with Keyframe editing.\u003cbr\u003e- Apply slow-motion effects to specific video parts.\u003cbr\u003e- Eliminate colors with Chromakey effects for immersive scenes.\u003cbr\u003e- Add multiple layers with Picture-in-Picture (PIP): video, images, stickers, effects, text.\u003cbr\u003e- Cover and mix video clips with Masking for unique effects.\u003cbr\u003e- Blur or pixelate sensitive areas with Mosaic.\u003cbr\u003e- Track moving objects for precise effects, text, or animations to follow their motion.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSpecial Features\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Generate Auto Captions \u0026amp; Caption Translation — AI speech-to-text and one-tap subtitle translation.\u003cbr\u003e- Remove backgrounds and change video background instantly.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eTrending Effects \u0026amp; Filters\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Apply various effects: Glitch, Fade, Weather, Retro DV, Blur, 3D.\u003cbr\u003e- Enhance videos with cinematic filters \u0026amp; color adjustments.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eMusic \u0026amp; Sound Effects\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Elevate videos with a vast library of music clips and sound effects.\u003cbr\u003e- Extract audio from video clips and recordings.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith VivaVideo — your all-in-one AI video editor \u0026amp; video maker with music — you can easily craft eye-catching content. Whether you\u0026#39;re a beginner or pro, generate, edit, and share high-quality videos in minutes!"],"QuVideo Inc. Video Editor \u0026 Video Maker App","500,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,