 device into a high‑quality document scanner and PDF toolkit trusted by millions worldwide. TapScanner lets you capture, organize, and share paperwork quickly, securely, and professionally.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy Choose TapScanner?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eHigh‑Quality Scans\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAutomatic edge detection and smart image correction create clear, professional scans of receipts, business cards, contracts, and multi‑page documents.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eComplete PDF Workspace\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMerge, split, reorder, sign, and annotate PDFs directly in the app. Export to standard PDF formats with no quality loss.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eOCR Text Recognition\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConvert images into searchable, editable text in over 110 languages.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eProductivity Boosters\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSave time with batch scanning, one‑tap renaming, and automated file organization.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSecure Cloud Backup\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSync scans to Google Drive, Dropbox, OneDrive, and more. Add password protection for sensitive documents.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eMulti‑Page Support\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eScan dozens of pages and compile them into a single, neatly ordered PDF.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eImage Enhancements\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAdjust brightness and contrast, remove shadows, and apply filters for optimal results.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eInstant Sharing \u0026amp; Printing\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSend scans via email, messaging apps, or print directly to any Wi‑Fi printer.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eUser‑Friendly Interface\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eClean design makes advanced tools easy for professionals, students, and everyday users alike.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDownload TapScanner and streamline your paperwork today!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFree Trial \u0026amp; Subscription Details\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAfter the free trial period, if the user does not cancel, the subscription will automatically convert to the paid version and be billed at the selected package price.\u003cbr\u003eYou can cancel the subscription at any time via the Google Play app by tapping the profile icon \u0026gt; Payments \u0026amp; subscriptions \u0026gt; Subscriptions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy Policy - https://tap.pm/privacy-policy-v5/\u003cbr\u003eService Terms - https://tap.pm/terms-of-service/"],"Tap AI","100,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kSxUNF8kmMmGf9i5gZd0YQbMVpD-UUmHrzHuofeLcTzqjqpfVChTg8a1auw3iI6imGm9KqCWWsJtEgOGszD0Dw"],null,[244,245,248,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"Digital Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dpdf.tap.scanner\u0026rdid\u003dpdf.tap.scanner\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$1.49 - $99.99 per item",[0]]],[[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dpdf.tap.scanner"]],["CCGqAm8abQgAShMImozA7Z/plgMVqKWDAx1qqROtsgRTCk8KFQoPcGRmLnRhcC5zY2FubmVyEAEYAxIZChM0ODI4NDYxNzU1MjcyOTY2NjkxEFEYAxgDIAMogPyRz4E0MIDLj8iKNEABSAFaAggBgAECMAg\u003d"],[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dpdf.tap.scanner\u0026rdid\u003dpdf.tap.scanner\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[null,"Erase stains from your document with TapScanner."],[null,"Got a scan ruined by dust, smudges, or fingerprints? TapScanner\u0026#39;s magic eraser fixes it in seconds. Just swipe over the imperfection and watch stains, marks, and defects disappear — no editing skills required. Every scan comes out crisp, clean, and ready to share. Whether it\u0026#39;s an old document, a receipt, or an important file, TapScanner gives you full control to make it look brand new. Say goodbye to smudged, unprofessional scans for good."],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/coxpBRiSnqx6Hb25VAtV6CFr_Ckpzhgj_qWxXoIksVau6dL0P0vVYSCsoHH2Klb3bLR636zYoFlfA7pKNfVV9Q"],null,[227,188,140,255]],null,"Update available",[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/eventdetails/4828461755272966691"]],2,null,["PDF Scanner app - TapScanner"],[[["Business",[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/category/BUSINESS"]],"BUSINESS"]]]]],[null,[[["com.peacocktv.peacockandroid",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FdlQY6tEE0p3FsJT9EbxB0BzKdXB1U84nNzAUl_YCC9HxRO1J82i8-XWuN_BD1zReblXht3-cvUreuogHrPk-A"],null,[23,23,23,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2484,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d5bHzWBCIWvzNWe828sg7o_idPmrRDmQrvmQctc5Z488ch4Nt_X8WumHEpFjHjOGAWez-xe2GBMYNK5mxzKq8w"]],[null,2,[2484,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TW-MQL5nand6gEpAF8xDzwceq5kidzlfFxnJ_vhVn0FE55K3nrr0Wx2tWJodiXm-HFeh8lIzgSKQrNV8To-u"]],[null,2,[2484,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ifxHzq-cWII_EKA7wxzXP9khNhcRjaCrb3iVggEvaIt3xGHfhwzyqGXlMHOufwkh1M5PrcsnMtea5_p54tU