ll,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003deasynotes.notes.notepad.notebook.privatenotes.note\u0026rdid\u003deasynotes.notes.notepad.notebook.privatenotes.note\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003deasynotes.notes.notepad.notebook.privatenotes.note"]],["CCGqApMBGpABCAZKEwiajMDtn+mWAxWopYMDHWqpE62yBHYKcgo4CjJlYXN5bm90ZXMubm90ZXMubm90ZXBhZC5ub3RlYm9vay5wcml2YXRlbm90ZXMubm90ZRABGAMSGQoTNDgyNzkyMzQxOTEyNTExNDY2OBBRGAMYASACKIDon4CINDCA/OG3jjRAAUgBWgIIAYABAjAI"],null,[null,"Create notes, memos and lists with the best note-taking app for Android!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEasy Notes is built for simple, everyday note taking. Capture quick notes, shopping lists, reminders and ideas in seconds, all in one place.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMake everyday note taking simple and personal. Write quick notes and checklists, add photos or voice memos, and customize your notebook with colorful backgrounds, fonts and themes. From organizing notes with categories to keeping them on your home screen with widgets, Easy notepad fits the way you like to record your life.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eEasy Notes Features \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e📒 Notepad free and notebook free for note-taking apps\u003cbr\u003e🖼 Photo notes, voice memos, sticky notes widget\u003cbr\u003e📌 Pin memos, goodnotes and view them with notes widget\u003cbr\u003e🗓 Sort notepad,note book by time\u003cbr\u003e🗂 Organize notepad by color, category, tags\u003cbr\u003e📥 Save notes automatically when take notes\u003cbr\u003e📋 Take checklist and memo with calendar\u003cbr\u003e✍️ Draw in this note taking app for students\u003cbr\u003e⬆️ Cloud sync and local backup to keep notes safe\u003cbr\u003e🛎 Set up notes reminders in notepad \u0026amp; notebook\u003cbr\u003e📅 Calendar notes writer for good note taker \u003cbr\u003e🔐 Lock notes and keep notes as a personal note app\u003cbr\u003e🎨 Make color sticky notes on tablet and phone\u003cbr\u003e👀 Sticky notes free and view notebook by sticky note widget\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNotebook, Notas, Free Notes App\u003cbr\u003eSimple Note Taking for Daily Life \u003cbr\u003eEasy Notes is a good note taking apps for notebooks. No complicated workspace or heavy setup. Just open your notepad, write what you need, and organize it in a way that makes sense to you.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCreate a quick memo when an idea appears. Make a grocery list before shopping. Save a photo inside a note. Record a voice memo when typing is inconvenient. Pin an important note, add a sticky notes widget to your home screen, or set a reminder in Notepad for something you cannot miss.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDraw \u0026amp; Write by Hand \u003cbr\u003eAdd simple doodles, sketches and handwritten notes to your powful notepad. Choose from different pens, colors, and templates to capture ideas in a more visual way. Easy Notes is designed for quick everyday drawing and handwriting, rather than complex professional note taking apps.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEasy Note Organization with Categories \u003cbr\u003eMake notes for school, work, or other usage scenarios. This easy note pad, note taking apps, good notes app help you categorize notes into different tabs. Manage your notes more efficiently and easily.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHome Screen Notes \u0026amp; Sticky Notes Widget \u003cbr\u003eKeep your sticky notes right on your home screen with Easy Notes widgets. View important notes, memos and checklists without opening the app, or quickly jump back into your notebook when you need to write something down.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePersonalized Notes \u0026amp; Notebook \u003cbr\u003eEasy Notes is a good notes widget app that supports color notes writers. Choose different notas backgrounds, note colors, fonts and sticky note widget styles to create a notebook that matches your style. Use bright sticky notes、good notes app for reminders, or simple backgrounds for work and school notes！\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCalendar Notes \u0026amp; Daily Planning \u003cbr\u003eUse this note pad to view your memos and quick notes in calendar note app mode. Note taking apps help to write notes, memos or organize notes in the form of a calendar. In a word, you can notetaking anytime and anywhere.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCloud Sync \u0026amp; Local Backup \u003cbr\u003eEasy Notes can sync notes between tablet and phone through Google Drive. Never worry about losing notes and memo. Easy to share notes, images, and voice memo to others.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePrivate Notes \u0026amp; Note Lock \u003cbr\u003eLock notepad helps keep notes app private with passwords. Note writer with lockers protect one note pad or the entire notes category to keep all good notes app safe.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEasy to start. Easy to organize. Made for everyday life. Easy Notes brings notes, memos, checklists, sticky notes and everyday organization together in one simple, personal and easy-to-use notebook free app.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAny issues, mail us via easynotes@guloolootech.com\u003cbr\u003eThank you for using Notepad, Notebook, Note taking apps, Free Note widget App."],"Gulooloo Tech Co., Ltd.","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yuiX3HPZ4NraiFwgGCqzQLRzz0ZD6_r4CY6OJok-SpIhFCfRrlJHiV9Bcz-GARAnxVCrDFKl2Ho281ll_uT4"],null,[253,251,244,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,[null,"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy 