ull,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/r5H0sgf7lMByk0vVqQnvAZBAkiMy6oJAKfVDLN5VfgpLIvLk98pniek4Zmo_Yh1dMOpmRJgkaLegjRWyVX24qQ"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C7v73KJ0BOtu_VtSQqd0xU7y2OD0DHrj6LdcumxG4sOwrpJ3HbPqjT8lfyB7pMO00wfEnqR-mJFKn5r08gvPeA"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JgrTLZx1Oc5-TfYSJ_Pa_R58X0GgimVbtLSiyAQtsXW9QOib7cDveGr2CvUU5oyX6whzOt6B8FU8AxkJqCzLFac"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Bj9PNTWRoVjqSPU9yqKR3FjL0rVhJiTJ5P9J_Q8Lo1skmZWc_lQYcyXQO3VEP4LygPSeTL87XQYHESWPYZ24RCw"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Iq1_er6eNwnhq-nljbbgAMgh2rPw6ugckOYZeURonkCYA1-bUW1Ojw1iOb9vY1TkuYvCskFZR3by5wV6THiYr0Y"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ACBVJpKz9dbksXD_dbehgHNNK4oRoBPfSnyG9uFBOi7Inppqu-go2lcOv_iTaB9fj8k60uR5lG5fi5NAvz1c1yM"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Zat6FsESCb-jVbMC46ZzOEVWjQwfd1QRy7a1fZsguZ4Yy27sGtZjJ1Fy3YWHBmASJVhKOgg7gx4YIC3KA4WMSA"]]],"TextNow: Call + Text Unlimited",["4.6",4.601513],"Communication",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.enflick.android.TextNow\u0026rdid\u003dcom.enflick.android.TextNow\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.enflick.android.TextNow"]],["qgJmGmQIABIjCiEKG2NvbS5lbmZsaWNrLmFuZHJvaWQuVGV4dE5vdxABGANKEwiajMDtn+mWAxWopYMDHWqpE62aARMImK/JvPnolgMVhqKDAx01jiI2+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA"],null,[null,"Call and text for free with TextNow, the free phone service with over 100 million users. Get nationwide coverage with unlimited talk and text on 5G—starting at $0/month.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYour phone service should work on your terms. No phone bill, no fixed contracts, no hidden fees.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat makes us different? \u003cbr\u003e• No phone bill, no fixed contracts, and no hidden fees\u003cbr\u003e• Get a free local phone number or keep your own for a private second line or business use\u003cbr\u003e• Flexible data options: choose the plan that fits your life, and change it anytime\u003cbr\u003e• Low-cost international calling to 230+ countries\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFREE TALK \u0026amp; TEXT NATIONWIDE: NO PHONE BILL, NO FIXED CONTRACTS \u003cbr\u003eStay connected with the TextNow free Wi-Fi calling and texting app, or activate TextNow Wireless on your existing phone to freely call and text without connecting to Wi-Fi. Get started instantly—no new device needed.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eFREE PLAN \u003cbr\u003eUnlimited talk and text on a nationwide 5G network — at $0/month, month after month. Not a trial. Not an introductory offer. Just free phone service, done differently.\u003cbr\u003eActivate our eSIM on your phone instantly with no commitments and no hidden fees.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDATA PLANS: FLEXIBLE \u0026amp; ON YOUR TERMS\u003cbr\u003eOnly pay for the data you use with no long-term contracts or commitments. We\u0026#39;re the only provider with truly flexible data options.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• Free Plan: Unlimited talk and text on nationwide 5G. Included monthly for $0.\u003cbr\u003e• Plus Plan: Unlimited nationwide talk, text, and data—except media streaming \u0026amp; gaming. No ads.\u003cbr\u003e• Unlimited Plan: Unlimited nationwide talk, text, and data. No ads.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChange your plan anytime in the app. Cancel anytime. No runaround, no fees. Pay what you want, or not at all.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSECOND PHONE NUMBER: FOR PRIVATE CALLING \u0026amp; TEXTING, A SEPARATE BUSINESS LINE \u0026amp; MORE\u003cbr\u003eUse the TextNow app as a free second phone line. Perfect for a 2nd line, business phone, side hustles, or personal use. Free calls and texts without an extra phone bill. Use it for private texting with new contacts, or as a business texting number for clients and customers.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eINTERNATIONAL CALLING: LOW-COST ACROSS 230+ COUNTRIES\u003cbr\u003eHave friends and family overseas? TextNow offers free calls to Mexico and Canada with low-cost international calls to 230+ countries, with rates starting at less than $0.01 per minute. No separate international calling app needed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWHY TEXTNOW?\u003cbr\u003e• Call and text for free immediately when you download the TextNow app—no bill, no fees\u003cbr\u003e• Activate on your existing phone and talk and text on a nationwide 5G network without Wi-Fi\u003cbr\u003e• Get a local phone number or keep your existing number. Area codes available across most metro areas in the US\u003cbr\u003e• Free voice calls, direct messages, SMS messages, picture and video messaging to the US or Canada\u003cbr\u003e• Flexible data options—only pay when you want it\u003cbr\u003e• Use on multiple devices including your computer or tablet and effortlessly access calls and texts whenever you need them\u003cbr\u003e• Low-cost international calls across 230+ countries\u003cbr\u003e• Voicemail-to-text audio transcription and conference calling\u003cbr\u003e• Free texting and calls over Wi-Fi\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHOW IS TEXTNOW FREE?\u003cbr\u003eThere are no yearly or monthly fees to use TextNow. We partner with brands to pay for your phone service (so you don\u0026#39;t have to) through in-app ads. Ads won\u0026#39;t interrupt your experience. If you don\u0026#39;t want ads, upgrade to the Plus Plan or Unlimited Plan to remove them.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMORE FEATURES STANDARD FOR ALL USERS\u003cbr\u003e• Passcode for safe and private texting and calling\u003cbr\u003e• Caller ID\u003cbr\u003e• Customizable free text tones, call tones, ringtones, vibrations, and phone backgrounds\u003cbr\u003e• Quick Reply to speedily respond to friends\u003cbr\u003e• A home screen widget for instant use\u003cbr\u003e• Text from your computer and seamlessly synchronize with your mobile device via textnow.com\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDownload the app and take control of your phone service, starting today.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFollow us on social for the latest news and offers:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• TikTok — @textnow\u003cbr\u003e• Facebook — @textnow\u003cbr\u003e• Instagram — @textnow\u003cbr\u003e• Twitter/X — @TextNow\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy policy: https://www.textnow.com/privacy \u003cbr\u003eTerms of use: https://www.textnow.com/terms"],"TextNow, Inc.","100,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/snr4An9EpKKrU7fCByBTgTfjm-dAnXuBDpo8myOKwhRQ22309AmrZmOLkho4ovvlGwIVkSIhglO57Pa5I0w_aQ"],null,[42,212,133,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.enflick.android.TextNow\u0026rdid\u003dcom.enflick.android.TextNow\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.29 - $99.99 per item",[0]]],[["com.facebook.lite",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HWNSz5n5jIISnAJDfnReYsNN565LJlEBfg8GoCsGWpS-rbt9txAwXCQCSJkpl8UObQLRqrGx2xi50epl1JfKP4o"],null,[255,255,255,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1376,817],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wi79eAaROhEk05Sh9lc511tSmyTx6QFYAL7dN8zWM2eCjK6Ttb1ZJ88xx9eD-d3vWLcuXFXTjkpWJpecwZ2UKaA"]],[null,2,[1376,817],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C9_D7--dlIM7Vhq7jVbVM547OllsTtPZxUzQWsShM-wcQb_XM0w8bgoakmJ2JTKsIHvOLWYl2a3Q0uyZNpJT-FU"]],[null,2,[1376,816],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bfzSJYKwTRBbJBTGYccCTOBvNTnUiMeqLlbZMuxdtI7IyCWIgQPmsgI-aXgd2YHXMf5msu-37_Ok_DpYH43kdw"]],[null,2,[1280,721],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CyK2hJJQX8SnkOj6x-PPi9HCMB_-8hzo3771O1Qowu7br7VzMkmlxFajKBe7g0iddVfcxZRMxW4ockX7N17AmQ"]],[null,2,[1284,732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9k7d9KlWKFDO32sMUqwnxgYYiS0NKFREJme3LXgACzOmQa3E3zi8qhlFd2-dONAIyb-aLCcb01-NRvJSBAVzimQ"]]],"Facebook Lite",["4.5",4.5102196],"Social",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.facebook.lite\u0026rdid\u003dcom.facebook.lite\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.facebook.lite"]],["qgJkGmIIARIZChcKEWNvbS5mYWNlYm9vay5saXRlEAEYA0oTCJqMwO2f6ZYDFailgwMdaqkTrZoBEwiYr8m8+eiWAxWGooMDHTWOIjb6ARcKFQi1m6b6koGOj0MSCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\u003d\u003d"],null,[null,"Keeping up with friends is faster and easier than ever with the Facebook Lite app! Use Facebook Lite as a friends app to connect and keep up with your social network. The Facebook Lite app is small, allowing you to save space on your phone and use Facebook in 2G conditions. Many of the classic features of Facebook are available on the app, such as sharing to a Timeline, liking photos, searching for people, and editing your profile and groups. Specific features include:\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e • Find friends and family\u003cbr\u003e • Post status updates \u0026amp; use Facebook emoji to help relay what’s going on in your world\u003cbr\u003e • Share photos and your favorite memes\u003cbr\u003e • Get notified when friends like and comment on your posts\u003cbr\u003e • Find local social events, RSVP, and make plans to meet up with friends\u003cbr\u003e • Interact with your friends by adding your own comments or reactions to their Facebook posts\u003cbr\u003e • Save photos by adding them to photo albums\u003cbr\u003e • Follow people to get their latest news\u003cbr\u003e • Look up local businesses to see reviews, operation hours, and pictures\u003cbr\u003e • Buy and sell locally on Facebook Marketplace\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe Facebook app does more than help you stay connected with your friends and interests. It\u0026#39;s also your personal organizer for storing, saving and sharing photos. It\u0026#39;s easy to share photos straight from your Android camera, and you have full control over your photos and privacy settings. You can choose when to keep individual photos private or even set up a secret photo album to control who sees it.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eFacebook Lite also helps you keep up with the latest news and current events around the world. Subscribe to your favorite celebrities, brands, websites, artists, or sports teams to follow their News Feeds from the convenience of your Facebook Lite app!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConsumer Health Privacy Policy: https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policies/health \u003cbr\u003eProblems with downloading or installing the app? See https://www.facebook.com/help/fblite \u003cbr\u003eStill need help? Please tell us more about the issue: https://www.facebook.com/help/contact/640732869364975\u003cbr\u003eFacebook is only available to people aged 13 and over.\u003cbr\u003eTerms of Service: http://m.facebook.com/terms.php"],"Meta Platforms, Inc.","1,000,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,nul