Qbm-kYZMcWw"]],[null,2,[720,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/evsVurVnYwmf-9Ocwa7uqJtmqVI20PG2l8BoQZxRvKoO6nMVcMcwrSSlp8PqSaLfHKpXwBr1-FA_U7TmjDwC"]],[null,2,[720,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_wp73Alnak8Eo8THiMxIchuHOFf1bMiFWcCQk1oY9a8KnO0Fl7r2IK0017qz1Mg47005YhsKcO1b2-dLbJFJ3A"]],[null,2,[720,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g4C3apurCmZ-jpkHi429-_s_ijlfkuq_9BpW9ssCM0YYu9Ft-lN_YM4Qlz7Hj74SFp8lcNLxen5Gp90L0YAg0Q"]],[null,2,[720,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-mFh5HIKwkegHuJG5Fme8nHIyzdMO9GOCYGlLAM-0KDMRzVUk3LVxG3nWgY6cugsbvYIYK346uJBSq_msFE2wks"]]],"Weverse: Connect with Artists",["4.6",4.649287],"Social",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dco.benx.weverse\u0026rdid\u003dco.benx.weverse\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dco.benx.weverse"]],["qgJaGlgIAxIXChUKD2NvLmJlbngud2V2ZXJzZRABGANKEwiajMDtn+mWAxWopYMDHWqpE62aARMImK/JvPnolgMVhqKDAx01jiI2+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA"],null,[null,"■ A Community for Fans and Artists\u003cbr\u003e· Check out the daily stories, major updates, LIVEs, and media of the artists and leave comments and likes.\u003cbr\u003e· Use the auto-translation feature to overcome the language barrier! Posts and comments by artists can also be auto-translated into the selected language.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Instant Answers with Weverse AI\u003cbr\u003e· Use the Weverse AI icon located at the top right of the Weverse home screen to look up information fast.\u003cbr\u003e· Tap suggested questions across Weverse to view answers, or easily search for major notices, LIVEs, and various merch.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Communicate in Real-Time on Weverse LIVE\u003cbr\u003e· Watch the artists stream in real-time on Weverse LIVE and send messages and hearts in real-time!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Share your music and connect - Listening Party\u003cbr\u003e· Connect your streaming service to Weverse, listen to music together, and communicate in real-time with the Listening Party.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Get Closer to Your Favorite Artists on Weverse DM\u003cbr\u003e· Subscribe to Weverse DM, where you can talk directly with artists! You can subscribe using Jelly, Weverse\u0026#39;s digital currency.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Shop on Weverse\u003cbr\u003e· Head to the Shop tab to purchase official merch and albums, check your order history, and get real-time notifications more conveniently!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Your Ultimate Companion for Offline Events, Spot\u003cbr\u003e· From live concerts to pop-up stores and exhibitions—explore complete event details all in one place on the Spot tab.\u003cbr\u003e· Unlock a seamless offline event experience with interactive features like the Stamp Rally, Pickup, Queues, and Saved QR Codes.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Express Your Heart with Fan Letters\u003cbr\u003e· Unleash your creativity and use various templates and decoration features provided to send your love and support to your favorite artists.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Archive Your Fan Activities with Collection\u003cbr\u003e· Earn badges and Collectibles based on your fan activities and complete missions to acquire badges and Collectibles, such as digital items like images and videos.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Diverse and Exclusive Media Content\u003cbr\u003e· Watch a wide range of media content, from artist official content to Weverse-exclusive media content, on Weverse with global subtitles!\u003cbr\u003e· Enjoy the exclusive content and benefits only available for official membership holders!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Access Permissions]\u003cbr\u003e* Required\u003cbr\u003e- Device \u0026amp; App History: Check app errors and improve usability\u003cbr\u003e- Device ID: Device identification\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* Optional\u003cbr\u003e- Camera: Write posts, recognize images, and record video content\u003cbr\u003e- Photos/Media/Files: Write posts and download media\u003cbr\u003e- Location: Access queue services and purchase certain products\u003cbr\u003e- Notifications: Receive alerts for content, notices, etc.\u003cbr\u003e- Microphone: Record video and audio content\u003cbr\u003e- Local Network: Connect with devices such as Chromecast\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e* You can use the service even if you do not agree to the optional access permissions. However, some features may be restricted if you do not agree. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Stay Connected with Weverse]\u003cbr\u003e- X: @weverseofficial\u003cbr\u003e- Instagram: @weverseofficial\u003cbr\u003e- YouTube: @weverse\u003cbr\u003e- TikTok: @weverseofficial\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Subscriptions on Weverse]\u003cbr\u003e▷ Weverse offers two monthly subscription services: [BTS behind] and [TXT behind].\u003cbr\u003e[BTS behind] monthly subscription: $2.99 (Based on the KRW price, VAT included)\u003cbr\u003e[TXT behind] monthly subscription: $2.99 (Based on the KRW price, VAT included)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTerms of Use: https://weverse.io/policies/terms\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://weverse.io/policies/privacy\u003cbr\u003eInquiry: support@weverse.io\u003cbr\u003eCustomer Service: 1544-0790 (Available only in South Korea)"],"WEVERSE COMPANY Inc.","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/syNLQuiVcm8jNwwevojeKywnnN6B0WhI-upLHZBTlvIkH05fjkBgF9IBNr-Oak3gOKsZyvo2itkJxNoADTRcLg"],null,[1,11,89,255]],null,["Teen",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dco.benx.weverse\u0026rdid\u003dco.benx.weverse\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.49 - $200.00 per item",[0]]],[["com.discord",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w2DdjDHGSj3DQElQQM0_J3PsNsALS-WD3CBeH0aXOYceR-F3aT02gFonhoFzz-Tc9ec8Dx9cLqh48-tzIFcP"],null,[88,101,242,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J9G3W2wuETDZ-RP6AY_o3RP0BrjfeYSBTOKs85ncp_dsfsqgKXDrxrl0DZKbpinxgUaKNYODlKGPkSTZpgcM"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rCrgLNcFYQAfu5QGnYNEfmdQvfoiQEt9aps_Twc7GoNgNixm9myh87x1XauJ9geFSyiBzJrECohl25udMXur"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rM_OIzDT0pgTwwbIpO_9o6k_dgxTIGC4kX8DTRHMxuo_EdeZMOzn9cVYlKWEHgxH81vc5TzHxCscE-utAH44Dw"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xmU17vPLpnRr0fKpVzGjK-48it7V7gTtNHYiNOMsxdO2QZRrm5SuE5RRABT_9QFXfy-ZVDLR2XYFGsITQzQd1hM"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F0bM83WDKo57ebdB-2mRIASaNhB0DBbn5Rb5MzH-KmH0N-HOb7CH902Y6JU_TPtuviT_R6LPNxMit4QtFxXE0w"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CCEXqP2sIPVBowFcdrCiqG1oajZ_CSVkoqNXJVR5m8BVccYZ5qnwjftbgUvghLUlYz2SOVAnslMBRuwruRqxVw"]],[null,2,[1080,1921],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/14UQX6a3mmXsazVjXag6AK8zZtgqtiRwpc_HGLgA62vpJOpGvbI4LqOoJpjESLgOI0Pjl_eiBC5RmiQDhRiarg"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O2n-IDwxSyBi2ja89eXQJzO4t2jyThFQ51WD9eP51V3BlwHTRTQXkOFZ1WAwCGr-RvTQMt6aULmpcq074DA6"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vCAFi1L2RLhHk3qWalCc2S--D7Amw5RuCUL9DbCQcGP3ziw1j5Q7HYt9Z6l0jAiVNAN9sEoCfA1Z6v08MOIB_Q"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uEN5niCOlrBzgepGJRPyWxrEHWqlRpolRsVcfr1ybusQ6tls-0s0cauf3Xge4HUSu_DubCN7KwhBGBCfRjkw5A"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HkHj3V0v5kzbbb3pREw9G7nn8KJoBZAHLaMP-Xk-BaLcLKrWs6eagRYPZ07isGz3KcwN9X48khirdu2s-gDu"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yHkWtCr3zoDVXG1PE2vvQLUSH4gqQlxSrO7zVgqeQEtzO8pcf-P2JoFz90TffP-kadQM7NTVuiGfP-nZZsq9w7k"]]],"Discord - Talk, Play, Hang Out",["4.3",4.2819314],"Communication",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.discord\u0026rdid\u003dcom.discord\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.discord"]],["qgJWGlQIBBITChEKC2NvbS5kaXNjb3JkEAEYA0oTCJqMwO2f6ZYDFailgwMdaqkTrZoBEwiYr8m8+eiWAxWGooMDHTWOIjb6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAA\u003d"],[[[null,null,"UHPZHtLElfY",[null,null,"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:UHPZHtLElfY?autoplay\u003d1\u0026embed\u003dplay"],"yt:movie:UHPZHtLElfY",null,null,null,null,"AXH1ezmztkqE3mOJCYgZ7e3avyBr57LeYexaiyTwBIvTeUHpF3s-WloPjKn25_X7k_28e4XmaB2WVFHD6M9IwaVaxjVVFTYU-6yBaMs2mbeR02LGMZbmrYzUrStsxzHDcrYFtnI7bQyGfxPTgFklTkIVLKuHNz8AMTkiLcxGFGTGLql0aOfDYW6kpCTPA9MwGyziqN2xXpqbBJEIxtXVDUrexGgNRwOcDLoPyOAWWKLJH2KwShheG_ymBzTPn5KOKoEq5lyNs2T_xgnhKrSEIDOVkJxtNNjJ8TQiiC_lH3JbOQ\u003d\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UHPZHtLElfY/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Discord is designed for gaming and great for just chilling with friends or building a community. Customize your own space and gather your friends to talk while playing your favorite games, or just hang out.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGROUP CHAT THAT’S ALL FUN \u0026amp; GAMES\u003cbr\u003e∙ Discord is great for playing games and chilling with friends, or even building a worldwide community. Customize your own space to talk, play, and hang out in.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMAKE YOUR GROUP CHATS MORE FUN\u003cbr\u003e∙ Create custom emoji, stickers, soundboard effects, and more to add your personality to voice, video, or text chat. Set your avatar, a custom status, and write your own profile to show up in chat your way.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSTREAM LIKE YOU’RE IN THE SAME ROOM\u003cbr\u003e∙ High-quality and low-latency streaming makes it feel like you\u0026#39;re hanging out on the couch with friends while playing a game, watching shows, looking at photos, or idk doing homework or something.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHOP IN WHEN YOU’RE FREE, NO NEED TO CALL\u003cbr\u003e∙ Easily hop in and out of voice or text chats without having to call or invite anyone, so you can chat with your friends before, during, and after your game session.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSEE WHO’S AROUND TO CHILL\u003cbr\u003e∙ See who’s around, playing games, or just hanging out. For supported games, you can see what modes or characters your friends are playing and directly join up.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eALWAYS HAVE SOMETHING TO DO TOGETHER\u003cbr\u003e∙ Watch videos, play built-in games, listen to music, or just scroll together and spam memes. Seamlessly text, call, video chat, and play games, all in one group chat.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWHEREVER YOU GAME, HANG OUT HERE\u003cbr\u003e∙ On your PC, phone, or console, you can still hang out on Discord. Easily switch between devices and use tools to manage multiple group chats with friends."],"Discord Inc.","500,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eW-qwzSvdNtjL9fNKk7kx5IaPZZpNXJWWtVOcu23rHBJZ1mStilSf6247c_Zcd70QVDnDwiLp_0MxdlAZUuU_88"],null,[7,7,60,255]],null,["Teen",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.discord\u0026rdid\u003dcom.discord\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.99 - $274.94 per item",[0]]],[["com.voicechat.live.group",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DwurZKy8M-beYIPEK7AdIFBUyTQkQrlLQtQLyjSDAv3VcTDHcb_LP8XCtQBRPx10nsWtCw0GiXe7GfLFHVYV2w"],null,[1,172,254,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Gk1G-UHjwhhpy97_Vkxl0zIkQrXEkFqX6cTrQ10dSBrhwcS1J7ADNQWmkExNdOWiRmnpcq41oDKu14EppXKwHQ"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GFSHjzrAAabT8RqTxfd-Sf_J45RiaUJnzLCBnYo-4cOED-1GO2eFnE9YRAjqG1A0CUa0GJfmnHz1qMW4SXQl_g"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qor7bz4JjeIn8ZNXUFpObaueBms1am1sox1vxrvt4Wsjzgx4o6_ccZWlAcoAd_Is_Ow7pvmHw87OUBhBWWWQQw"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fb6RyXlAJjJWbF52BWI2pGBc1fsVnLreakDAGHlMssNWXXjJr6OibCBbAOn-G2nffQV1fnILUZT1wvwU5b6F_w"]],[null,2,[2688,1242],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rAg51ROMT8rjfQ2_CUtKSKLm3B4WwtfqChhz5e1_VHkXztg7j-BiLj9vJ4Ms62jim2Pwrnsvl_0QcpaNsq6E26A"]]],"YoHo: Group Voice Chat Room",["4.1",4.072034],"Social",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.voicechat.live.group\u0026rdid\u003dcom.voicechat.live.group\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.voicechat.live.group"]],["qgJjGmEIBRIgCh4KGGNvbS52b2ljZWNoYXQubGl2ZS5ncm91cBABGANKEwiajMDtn+mWAxWopYMDHWqpE62aARMImK/JvPnolgMVhqKDAx01jiI2+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA"],null,[null,"\u003cfont color\u003d\"#337BB6\"\u003e \u003cb\u003e👋Welcome to YoHo👋\u003c/b\u003e \u003cfont\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e There is a big party for you right now. YoHo has combined the most popular games with the most fluent voice chat system already. Don\u0026#39;t you wanna make friends? Here, now you can make friends every minute!\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e 🎮 Gaming Room, Chat Party 🎮\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou can play multiple games while chatting in voice chat rooms. YoHo now has more games than ever. Like Ludo(لودو), Uno, and Dominoes(الدومينو), arcade fishing game, you name it! Have more fun with friends from all over the world.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e👫Private Chat, More Secrets👫\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThere is a significant upgrade in the private chat room. Your potential new friends will be randomly generated as a list for you, and now you can record your voice. Tap the icons that you are interested in, listen to his/her voice and directly say hi to them without any barriers. You will find it has been easier to make a friend than ever since.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e 🎉 Group Voice Chat, More Happiness🎉\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCreate a group voice chat room, invite friends, or wait for strangers to join in, use text or voice to live chat with friends, enjoy the fun of a great voice chat party.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e 🎡 Social Network, Various Activities🎡 \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWanna hold a birthday party, share your wonderful stories, discuss your new findings with audiences? There is a playground for you now! The capability will be limitless. Make new friends as many as possible!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎁Virtual Gifts, More Surprise🎁\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYoHo offers lots of amazing virtual gifts that customize to your local country! Strengthen the friendship between you and your friends by sending cute virtual gifts.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e💯Easy to register, User-Friendly💯\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUse a message and Facebook to sign up for a YoHo account. It is easier and time-saving. Enjoy your audio chat experience quickly and easily.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e"],"YoHo Studio","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BBJ_BYo46a4hb5tnLrgj9AwTQdYujAgp-bpX85cPUELA54PTZ2X0xAfU431mPpZ2A5-9wsGW-Cbw8p1vyOfhKhw"],null,[254,186,104,255]],null,["Teen",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, Shares Location, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.voicechat.live.group\u0026rdid\u003dcom.voicechat.live.group\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["$0.29 - $99.99 per item",[0]]],[["com.mico",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yDnZiDBszKXpyMqqcmONJrfv7u6UGrakxlPSqHrm2fICQAge3caJC59i27Go7k_ORi_UQ6ASYav-cNujPE4BHg"],null,[130,50,255,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/plmbuRAvv0PXjkGAgPD1VaJO8C5XzBbcLhSpvvUwPr167JWBf_znD2CUQuum1F-GEW9NRIv28GWlsZ3abhT4"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WvlyK-5IpLtoYMbiJElWnSVu8Fg2rCV-Njp0MemqZCjBRzTznhCEypiUhccBhwk3W63iKTc3ox5NP9lBWUF_W6A"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ju_AVLXHnbuMvUL12N1ps-zMxOFGs7QAl5PPvhQxwJpY-QfsZHWkNbA6FVoWMxmupdXk3Gp-nFtCO79tOvY2gPM"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NN8vfJZm0ynYDub8kknr7Y17h_Ok5IMMIMc3w5814iQXQXtnIDTfZGzQyyGH3G99nLza33xhE_Nmes6sN8DhEg"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hdOzNTTmKtQWYRS_eGNajf3wKRkBqOZDcB7lNBQP875J4P6P1jtuvN8yHuaR0dMfPCsx5QUX1y8Ky1PV_6HDoA"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fbVsXrKjqcqlh4Bh2Gl29KsfnoahUgS83XKsu61a7uAt8MuC51rsQZ3EaAG2p-aRcjNzZf7YEso_haqYy9ei"]]],"MICO: Go Live Streaming \u0026 Chat",["4.1",4.1491613],"Social",null,null,[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.mico\u0026rdid\u003dcom.mico\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.mico"]],["qgJTGlEIBhIQCg4KCGNvbS5taWNvEAEYA0oTCJqMwO2f6ZYDFailgwMdaqkTrZoBEwiYr8m8+eiWAxWGooMDHTWOIjb6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAA\u003d"],null,[null,"\u003cb\u003eGlobal live stream, Live chat in chat room, Live single \u0026amp; multi-user guest call rooms with friends.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🌟Highlights🌟\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#BD613E\"\u003e💬Chat💬 - Chat with friends global directly\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#E78C17\"\u003e🤳Moments🤳 - Share your stories and online chat with people \u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#EACB22\"\u003e🎤Live🎤 - Live house, live chat, and live party \u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#2BECA3 \"\u003e🎉Party🎉 - Up to 9 people video chat, ready to be on cloud 9 \u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#2BCEEC \"\u003e💧Purity💧 - A positive, energetic and healthy environment for you  \u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\u003cbr\u003eMICO is a live streaming app that provides tons of International live streams for users. Here, you can watch talented live streams and make new talented friends, enjoy the live houses with exclusive creativity of broadcasters! Sounds exciting? Let\u0026#39;s check it out!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎤Live🎤 - Live streams, live chat, and live party\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWatch the international live stream and enjoy live videos. There are high-quality live streamers from the US, Thailand, Malaysia, and so on. They offer thousands of fantastic live shows every day. \u003cbr\u003eDancing, singing, talk show, online game, no matter what talent you have, MICO will be the biggest stage for broadcasting your skills. Everyone can be a star in MICO. New beautiful stickers and filters make you cuter, more beautiful, and more confident in the live video. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e💬Chat💬 - Live chat with friends either local or global directly in a chat room.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou can chat with your favorite broadcasters just one tap away, start an online chat \u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e🤳Moments🤳 - Share your stories with friends.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBy sharing photos and short videos on moments, you will catch your fan’s eyes around you and increase your popularity.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎉Party🎉 - Up to 9 people live call, ready to be on cloud 9\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe more people watching, the more fantastic the atmosphere will be. Join a group room, start an online party with friends, make new friends, and have fun by expanding your social circle.\u003cbr\u003e👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼👏🏼\u003cbr\u003eMeet talented broadcasters in MICO, one of the most popular worldwide social networking apps where you can enjoy an online chat, live streams, get more socialize and watch short videos \u0026amp; photos.\u003cbr\u003eYour happiness is our goal. Feel free to give us any feedback. We are happy to hear your complaints and advice:\u003cbr\u003eEmail: contact@micous.com\u003cbr\u003eTwitter: http://twitter.com/micoapp\u003cbr\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/micoteam\u003cbr\u003eFacebook:\u003cbr\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/micoapp\u003cbr\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/micoapp.english\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAdults Only 18+ Notice: This app is intended for adult users only. By using it, you confirm that you are at least 18 years old. Minors are prohibited from using this app, and falsifying your age will result in permanent account suspension. Users shall bear all liability arising from misrepresenting their age."],"Mico World","50,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nDcb9CW1pmg1VAe0TVNX7fKh2sk2Z-KAyYG4buhdNtoXsGaWLWjNZy4IN1GrQc_maK7GfMNPrfa6zX3A13-MGw"],null,[250,251,253,255]],null,["Mature 17+",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-App Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[2